e2b4b761-6d98-4fcf-af6a-d8c9edc70718	60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001	4	Exploring Kids Finding Little Star And Placing It In A Corresponding Pallet: Creative Tactile Studio	Children engage in open-ended creative construction and tactile exploration centered on Kids finding little star and placing it in a corresponding pallet.	{"AgeMax": 3, "AgeMin": 2, "Create": "A tangible collaborative model or collage.", "Together": "Children share building materials and describe what they are making to their peers.", "Challenge": "Can we design and build a display inspired by Kids finding little star and placing it in a corresponding pallet?", "Materials": ["Cardstock", "Washable craft adhesive", "Wooden craft sticks", "Textured paper scraps"], "Reflection": "What was your favorite texture or tool you used while exploring Kids finding little star and placing it in a corresponding pallet?", "ChildChoice": "Children choose which textures, shapes, and tools they wish to combine.", "Environment": "Indoor / Outdoor", "MagicMoment": "Noticing how different materials join together to form a new creation.", "GroupSizeMax": 10, "GroupSizeMin": 4, "Accomplishment": "Presenting their completed project during reflection circle.", "ExecutionGuide": {"Ask": "How does that piece feel when you touch it?", "Try": "Try connecting two different shapes together.", "Watch": "Observe hand-eye coordination and peer turn-taking.", "Phases": [{"Name": "Welcome & Material Touch", "ChildrenDo": "Feel materials and select initial pieces", "TeacherDoes": "Demonstrates gentle handling and asks open questions", "DurationMinutes": 5}, {"Name": "Hands-On Creation", "ChildrenDo": "Assemble and combine elements", "TeacherDoes": "Circulates, providing positive reinforcement", "DurationMinutes": 15}, {"Name": "Sharing & Clean-Up", "ChildrenDo": "Place finished crafts on drying rack and tidy up", "TeacherDoes": "Leads a gentle closing transition", "DurationMinutes": 5}], "Safety": ["Ensure only child-safe non-toxic adhesive is used", "Remind children that materials remain on the table"], "Closing": "Gather on the carpet for a quick proud celebration of everyone's work.", "Extensions": ["Take photos of finished structures to create a classroom storybook"], "Adaptations": ["Provide larger chunky pieces for developing fine-motor grip"], "Preparation": ["Cut paper into varied shapes", "Set out trays on low work tables"], "MaterialSetup": ["Place trays evenly within reach of small groups"], "EnvironmentSetup": ["Spacious floor or craft table with accessible trays"], "TeacherIntroduction": "Today we are exploring Kids finding little star and placing it in a corresponding pallet! Look at all these interesting textures we can build with.", "LittleMomentOpportunity": "Praise a child who noticed an interesting detail in their friend's project.", "SuggestedDurationMinutes": 25}, "TeacherGuidance": "Introduce materials at the low table. Encourage children to test how pieces fit together.", "DevelopmentalGoals": []}	Draft Saved	a824798d-e5f4-444d-9fa6-76491e2be21d	2026-10-15 00:06:05.627112+00
