669d9a46-2007-4562-a0c3-d0e5b6c2da16	009ed10c-1cb3-4275-987c-d039b6658272	1	Exploring Playing With Colorful Dough: Creative Tactile Studio (Focus: Make It More Playful)	Children engage in open-ended creative construction and tactile exploration centered on Playing with colorful dough. Adapted with emphasis on: Make it more playful.	{"AgeMax":5,"AgeMin":3,"Create":"A tangible collaborative model or collage.","Together":"Children share building materials and describe what they are making to their peers.","Challenge":"Can we design and build a display inspired by Playing with colorful dough? Challenge adaptation: Make it more playful.","Materials":["Cardstock","Washable craft adhesive","Wooden craft sticks","Textured paper scraps"],"Reflection":"What was your favorite texture or tool you used while exploring Playing with colorful dough?","Environment":"Indoor / Outdoor","MagicMoment":"Noticing how different materials join together to form a new creation.","GroupSizeMax":10,"GroupSizeMin":4,"Accomplishment":"Presenting their completed project during reflection circle.","ExecutionGuide":{"Ask":"How does that piece feel when you touch it?","Try":"Try connecting two different shapes together.","Watch":"Observe hand-eye coordination and peer turn-taking.","Phases":[{"Name":"Welcome \\u0026 Material Touch","ChildrenDo":"Feel materials and select initial pieces","TeacherDoes":"Demonstrates gentle handling and asks open questions","DurationMinutes":5},{"Name":"Hands-On Creation","ChildrenDo":"Assemble and combine elements","TeacherDoes":"Circulates, providing positive reinforcement","DurationMinutes":15},{"Name":"Sharing \\u0026 Clean-Up","ChildrenDo":"Place finished crafts on drying rack and tidy up","TeacherDoes":"Leads a gentle closing transition","DurationMinutes":5}],"Safety":["Ensure only child-safe non-toxic adhesive is used","Remind children that materials remain on the table"],"Closing":"Gather on the carpet for a quick proud celebration of everyone\\u0027s work.","Extensions":["Take photos of finished structures to create a classroom storybook"],"Adaptations":["Provide larger chunky pieces for developing fine-motor grip"],"Preparation":["Cut paper into varied shapes","Set out trays on low work tables"],"MaterialSetup":["Place trays evenly within reach of small groups"],"EnvironmentSetup":["Spacious floor or craft table with accessible trays"],"TeacherIntroduction":"Today we are exploring Playing with colorful dough! Look at all these interesting textures we can build with.","LittleMomentOpportunity":"Praise a child who noticed an interesting detail in their friend\\u0027s project.","SuggestedDurationMinutes":25},"TeacherGuidance":"Introduce materials at the low table. Encourage children to test how pieces fit together.","DevelopmentalGoals":[]}	Initial curated release from organization submission	50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	2026-10-17 11:38:21.211019+00	t
